## Model card

- **Name:** Gemini 3.8 Flash
- **Short description:** Google's latest multimodal AI model with enhanced reasoning capabilities and improved performance across various benchmarks. Released as part of Google's Gemini family, offering advanced capabilities for complex reasoning tasks and multimodal understanding.
- **Provider / access:** Google AI (gemini-3.8-flash), available through Google AI Studio, Gemini API, and Google Cloud Platform
- **Release / knowledge:** Released in 2024; knowledge cutoff continuously updated
- **IDs:** `google/gemini-3.8-flash` (proprietary API)
- **Context window:** 1 million tokens (official documentation)
- **Modalities:** Text, image, audio, and video input; text output; reasoning yes; tool calls supported; JSON mode supported
- **Pricing (as of 2026-10):** $0.15/MTok input, $0.60/MTok output (API pricing)
- **Architecture:** Transformer-based with enhanced reasoning capabilities and improved multimodal processing

